    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sniiirt!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006E0069006900690072007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Toh! Toh!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F0068002100200054006F006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s the Team MZ flag that Naveen made.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900742019007300200074006800650020005400650061006D0020004D005A00200066006C00610067002000740068006100740020004E0061007600650065006E0020006D006100640065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If guests see people battling Pokémon right out\nfront, they’re gonna think this is one weird hotel...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lay your heart bare in your Pokémon battles. That\nis how we learn who one another truly are.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Having a Pokémon by one’s side makes it easier\nto speak to others...even those we don’t yet know.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIn other words, Pokémon gift us the chance to\nlearn more about the world around us.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 189
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Simply living in the same city isn’t enough to\nbring people and Pokémon closer together.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lumiose is full of wonders. Experiencing wonder\nis what leads us to learn and understand.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It will not be possible to win the Z-A Royale if you\ncannot fully draw forth your Pokémon’s power.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAnd, of course, the way to achieve that is by truly\nknowing your Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 180
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I expect that Emma will set you on a good path to\nunderstanding this city.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I hope you’re enjoying the Infinite Z-A Royale—so\nlong as you’re getting enough sleep.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "After big catastrophes like the one we had with\nPrism Tower, more trouble tends to follow...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The folks at Quasartico must be having a rough\ntime of things...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI imagine <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001> is forcing croissant curry on\nthem as well.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Have you really got the time to be slacking off,\nPresident <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800610076006500200079006F00750020007200650061006C006C007900200067006F00740020007400680065002000740069006D006500200074006F00200062006500200073006C00610063006B0069006E00670020006F00660066002C000A0050007200650073006900640065006E0074002000100002018B0001003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve been getting a ton more experience through\nthe Infinite Z-A Royale.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI think I’ve got a real shot at winning big!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Seriously, what was with that old guy, though? He\nsure never drops that whole mysterious vibe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whether <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ<U+0001>she’s here at the hotel with us or not,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>’s still our team leader!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aw, Naveen. He tries to play it cool, but it’s so\nobvious he’s glad <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>’s here!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>My favorite part of the Infinite Z-A Royale is\ngonna be more battles with you,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "When we’re battling in the Infinite Z-A Royale, I’m\njust your rival—forget everything else!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know I’m off playing the big, capable CEO a lot\nof the time now, instead of being around...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut I wouldn’t be able to focus on that stuff if I\ndidn’t have you all here to count on. So thanks.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 201
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know I’m off playing the big, capable CEO a lot\nof the time now, instead of being around...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut I wouldn’t be able to focus on that stuff if I\ndidn’t have you all here to count on. So thanks.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 201
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s a sign for Ansha’s donut shop. Naveen made\nit for her.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007420190073002000610020007300690067006E00200066006F007200200041006E0073006800612019007300200064006F006E00750074002000730068006F0070002E0020004E0061007600650065006E0020006D006100640065000A0069007400200066006F00720020006800650072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Some of AZ’s old books are still placed here.\nAnsha seems to read them sometimes, too.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5196,
